	<section_number>15.2-5327</section_number>
	<catch_line>Powers of nonstock corporations</catch_line>
	<text>
		An authority shall have all powers granted to corporations under the provisions of § 13.1-826, including, without limitation, the power to own or control stock and nonstock subsidiaries.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 32-240.1; 1970, c. 554, § 15.1-1561; 1979, c. 719; 1986, c. 347; 1997, c. 587.</history>
